; the ledger of #499: amounts in another commodity than the budget's without a price, and spending after the
; budget-close. The same ledger as main.bean
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: "Food"

2024-01-01 budget Food CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Food 1000 CNY
