2024-01-10 * "Lunch in CNY"
  Expenses:Food 100 CNY
  Assets:Cash

2024-01-11 * "Lunch abroad in USD"
  Expenses:Food 20 USD
  Assets:Cash

2024-03-01 budget-close Food

2024-04-05 * "Lunch after the budget is closed"
  Expenses:Food 30 CNY
  Assets:Cash
